'''Spartakos Kitiou FC''' is a [[Cyprus|Cypriot]] football club based in [[Kiti, Cyprus|Kiti]], [[Cyprus]]. Founded in [[1958 in association football|1958]], the club was promoted to the [[2024–25 Cypriot Second Division]] after years of playing in lower leagues.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.24sports.com.cy/gr/sports/podosfairo/kypros/b-katigoria/spartakos-kitioy/me-proponiti-ton-kaiafa-kai-xoysmpaoyer-sto-roster|title=Σπάρτακος Κιτίου: Με προπονητή τον Καϊάφα και Χουσμπάουερ στο ρόστερ|date=26 May 2024}}</ref>

In 2024 they also qualified for the small club cup final.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://goal.philenews.com/podosfero/kypros/g-katigoria/proponitis-spartakou-efchomai-na-ginei-enas-oraios-telikos-kai-o-kalyteros-na-kerdisei/|title=Προπονητής Σπάρτακου: «Εύχομαι να γίνει ένας ωραίος τελικός και ο καλύτερος να κερδίσει»|language=el}}</ref>"}}
